  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Patreon-ff424d?logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8GydmUN3xq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Join our Discord-5865F2?logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"加入我們的 Discord\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fquillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support me-Ko--fi-571db5?logo=kofi&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上支持我\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Hiba550/Ore_Vein_Miner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/View on-GitHub-181717?logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"在 GitHub 上查看\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Hiba550/Ore_Vein_Miner\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Hiba550/Ore_Vein_Miner?style=social\" alt=\"為此倉庫點星\"> </a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/quillphen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49b1e899a9f41e7eeeb877bc53e8d5838998a95b_0.webp\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p><p><strong>礦脈礦工</strong></p><p>當你<strong>蹲下</strong>並用鎬子破壞一個礦石方塊時，它會自動開採相連的礦石方塊。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xl2GihRU/images/64ad1935bc25e006be50ed8fa4d9697da2639985.gif\" alt=\"礦脈開採範例 1\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Xl2GihRU/images/1e1388588ccb36007b8137ce4584200f31626d17.gif\" alt=\"礦脈開採範例 2\"></p><hr><h3>運作方式</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>蹲下（潛行）</strong>並用<strong>鎬子</strong>開採任何<strong>礦石方塊</strong>。整個<strong>相連的礦脈</strong>將被自動開採（支援絲綢之觸）</li>\n</ul><hr><h3>注意事項</h3><p><strong>偵測到幸運附魔時會自動禁用礦脈開採</strong></p>",
